=== zone z20q1
Catacombes 
C'est là qu'aura lieu la bataille finale de la Malédiction joon.

=== zone z25q1
Snowy wilderness
Although this place is almost uninhabited due to poor conditions, there is a small lumberjack village to the west, and it is the only safe place in the area. Sometimes the aurora borealis can be seen here.

=== zone z26q1
An old portal
In this cave there is a portal that has not been used for so long that it has been forgotten.
=== zone z31q1
The city of Dar-Leanos and its surroundings
This is all that remains of Cania, and even the fate of these lands is in question. The city is under attack from the undead, parasites have spread across the fields and highwaymen have taken over the passes. Despite the city's high and inaccessible walls, its demise is only a matter of time.


=== zone z35xq1
Sadrok City and Surrounding Area
The city of Sadrok and the lands around it are the mainstay of the Kadagan Empire on Jygran. Numerous armies of the living and the dead have gathered in the city, and there is Castle of Firez, a working harbor, a military academy, a necromancer's guild, and the homes of aristocrats. High in the mountains to the south is the Joon Prison.

